@startuml 06-state-task
title FlowAI Platform - Task State Machine

hide empty description

[*] --> Queued : REST POST /tasks (automation -> Router)

state Queued #LightYellow
state Preparing #LightYellow
state Running #LightBlue
state Succeeded #LightGreen
state Failed #LightCoral
state Cancelled #LightCoral
state Timeout #LightCoral

Queued --> Preparing : Router dispatches via REST to executor
Queued --> Cancelled : user cancel

Preparing --> Running : container started
Preparing --> Failed : pull / start error

Running --> Running : tool_use / llm_response
Running --> Succeeded : agent returns final
Running --> Failed : unhandled error / max_steps
Running --> Cancelled : user cancel (graceful)
Running --> Timeout : wall_clock > limit

Succeeded --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Timeout --> [*]

@enduml